},{"category":"Southern","historical_business_count":2},{"category":"American (New)","historical_business_count":2},{"category":"Cocktail Bars","historical_business_count":2}],"history":[{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), Bars, Breakfast & Brunch, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":6},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"OyF6c2he3Aej9itlH8oz-A","review_id":"9pkqq8oX1CGsErLUSzrTJQ","date":"2019-07-09T14:19:38","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9358680248260498,"text_excerpt":"Finally got to pop in after work and try this place - it's so cute! It was too hot to sit outside, but there were seats at the bar. After planning to be there specifically for happy hour, I did not order any drinks on the happy hour menu, but instead tried the Brandy Crusta, which was excellent, and a negroni cocktail, because it was negroni week. Chris Hannah was behind the bar so it was fun to chat with him and watch him make cocktails. My companion asked Chris to make him a spicy cocktail with tequila, and he declared it was the best cocktail he'd ever had in his life, and ordered another to go. I sampled the deviled eggs, which were delightfully spicy and a unique flavor. I can't wait..."},{"business_id":"OyF6c2he3Aej9itlH8oz-A","review_id":"yIL8_nTPl98rQfONGiFGnA","date":"2019-05-16T16:33:17","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9304441213607788,"text_excerpt":"My friend and i went on a cocktail bar crawl and had to stop here. It has no sign outside, only a older gentleman who greeted us. We got extremely lucky and found 2 spots at the bar. It's a very cozy place and has a super cute courtyard area but definitely get a res before or you won't get a spot. We had the Brandy Crusta which was so good. The bartender made me the best Pimms Cup i think ever had (had a little cucumber juice in it -dope). Def check it out if you love a crafted cocktail . They're all very pleasant too! Will have to try the food next time!"},{"business_id":"OyF6c2he3Aej9itlH8oz-A","review_id":"UFomrlYg_F2PvY1O5k-DoA","date":"2019-12-01T16:16:51","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9278115034103394,"text_excerpt":"We really enjoyed this place. Came here for my husband's birthday and both food and drinks were excellent. The menu changes frequently, so my advice would be don't be afraid of unusual things. Two items stood out, kombucha squash with N'Duja (a Calabrian thing, kind of like hot salami turned into a pate) and peanuts. Absolutely delicious. And ox tongue. I know. Tongue? It was so good. Sliced super thin and very flavorful. Just go. It was a lovely evening."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"OyF6c2he3Aej9itlH8oz-A","photo_id":"zv7OgzInc1dKY-7w47P6sQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/zv7OgzInc1dKY-7w47P6sQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8810995817184448},{"business_id":"OyF6c2he3Aej9itlH8oz-A","photo_id":"eeGxo1wP8aIVy-T6OOAppQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/eeGxo1wP8aIVy-T6OOAppQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8536100387573242},{"business_id":"OyF6c2he3Aej9itlH8oz-A","photo_id":"n875Mt3wU_DRD8NZk5WXMQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/n875Mt3wU_DRD8NZk5WXMQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8359273076057434},{"business_id":"OyF6c2he3Aej9itlH8oz-A","photo_id":"SSM69cmeleFKxO5n8Vdd5g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/SSM69cmeleFKxO5n8Vdd5g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8315398097038269},{"business_id":"OyF6c2he3Aej9itlH8oz-A","photo_id":"2YuqTRFREly5T2TDVNDmWQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/2YuqTRFREly5T2TDVNDmWQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8162292838096619}]},"notebook_case":null}
